{"title": "Orin's Ritual Note", "pageid": 40125, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Orin's_Ritual_Note", "categories": ["Notes", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Orin's Ritual Notes are found on the corpses along with the body parts of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dribbles\" title=\"Dribbles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Dribbles.png/25px-Portrait_Dribbles.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Dribbles.png/38px-Portrait_Dribbles.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Dribbles.png/50px-Portrait_Dribbles.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dribbles the Clown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Dribbles.png/25px-Portrait_Dribbles.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Portrait_Dribbles.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dribbles\" title=\"Dribbles\">Dribbles the Clown</a>.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ritual_Bhaalist_Display.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Ritual_Bhaalist_Display.png/400px-Ritual_Bhaalist_Display.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Ritual_Bhaalist_Display.png/600px-Ritual_Bhaalist_Display.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Ritual_Bhaalist_Display.png/800px-Ritual_Bhaalist_Display.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Ritual_Bhaalist_Display.png/400px-Ritual_Bhaalist_Display.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"286\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Ritual_Bhaalist_Display.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Orin's 'corpse art' depicting defeated Bhaalspawn</figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>There are six ritual notes, all titled in the same manner and found together with one of the body parts related to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Dribbles_the_Clown\" title=\"Find Dribbles the Clown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Dribbles the Clown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Find_Dribbles_the_Clown\" title=\"Find Dribbles the Clown\">Find Dribbles the Clown</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Illasera,_the_First\" title=\"Illasera, the First\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Illasera,_the_First\" title=\"Illasera, the First\">Illasera, the First</a> - <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clown%27s_Severed_Torso\" title=\"Clown's Severed Torso\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Clown_Torso_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Clown_Torso_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Clown_Torso_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Clown_Torso_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Clown_Torso_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Clown_Torso_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Clown_Torso_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Clown_Torso_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Clown_Torso_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clown%27s_Severed_Torso\" title=\"Clown's Severed Torso\">Clown's Severed Torso</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yaga-Shura,_the_Second\" title=\"Yaga-Shura, the Second\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Yaga-Shura,_the_Second\" title=\"Yaga-Shura, the Second\">Yaga-Shura, the Second</a> - <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clown%27s_Severed_Arm\" title=\"Clown's Severed Arm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Clown_Arm_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Clown_Arm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Clown_Arm_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Clown_Arm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Clown_Arm_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Clown_Arm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Clown_Arm_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Clown_Arm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Clown_Arm_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clown%27s_Severed_Arm\" title=\"Clown's Severed Arm\">Clown's Severed Arm</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sendai,_the_Third\" title=\"Sendai, the Third\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sendai,_the_Third\" title=\"Sendai, the Third\">Sendai, the Third</a> - <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clown%27s_Severed_Leg\" title=\"Clown's Severed Leg\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Clown_Leg_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Clown_Leg_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Clown_Leg_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Clown_Leg_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Clown_Leg_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Clown_Leg_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Clown_Leg_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Clown_Leg_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Clown_Leg_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clown%27s_Severed_Leg\" title=\"Clown's Severed Leg\">Clown's Severed Leg</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abazigal,_the_Fourth\" title=\"Abazigal, the Fourth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Abazigal,_the_Fourth\" title=\"Abazigal, the Fourth\">Abazigal, the Fourth</a> - <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clown%27s_Severed_Foot\" title=\"Clown's Severed Foot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Clown_Foot_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Clown_Foot_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Clown_Foot_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Clown_Foot_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Clown_Foot_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Clown_Foot_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Clown_Foot_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Clown_Foot_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Clown_Foot_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clown%27s_Severed_Foot\" title=\"Clown's Severed Foot\">Clown's Severed Foot</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar,_the_Fifth\" title=\"Balthazar, the Fifth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar,_the_Fifth\" title=\"Balthazar, the Fifth\">Balthazar, the Fifth</a> - <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clown%27s_Severed_Pelvis\" title=\"Clown's Severed Pelvis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Clown_Waist_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Clown_Waist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Clown_Waist_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Clown_Waist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Clown_Waist_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Clown_Waist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Clown_Waist_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Clown_Waist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Clown_Waist_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clown%27s_Severed_Pelvis\" title=\"Clown's Severed Pelvis\">Clown's Severed Pelvis</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amelyssan,_the_Sixth\" title=\"Amelyssan, the Sixth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amelyssan,_the_Sixth\" title=\"Amelyssan, the Sixth\">Amelyssan, the Sixth</a> - <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clown%27s_Severed_Head\" title=\"Clown's Severed Head\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Clown_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Clown_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Clown_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Clown_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Clown_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Clown_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Clown_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Clown_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Clown_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clown%27s_Severed_Head\" title=\"Clown's Severed Head\">Clown's Severed Head</a></li></ul>\n<p>All these names are <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaalspawn\" title=\"Bhaalspawn\">Bhaalspawn</a> participating in the events of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Bhaalspawn_Crisis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaalspawn Crisis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Bhaalspawn_Crisis\">Bhaalspawn Crisis</a></span> (namely group of <i>The Five</i> and their leader, Amelyssan), placed in order of their demise. Each letter contains a short epitaph to the named person and is signed by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/38px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/50px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orin the Red\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin the Red</a>.\n</p><p>These letters actually confirm constable <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devella_Fountainhead\" title=\"Devella Fountainhead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Portrait_Devella_Fountainhead.png/25px-Portrait_Devella_Fountainhead.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Portrait_Devella_Fountainhead.png/38px-Portrait_Devella_Fountainhead.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Portrait_Devella_Fountainhead.png/50px-Portrait_Devella_Fountainhead.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devella Fountainhead's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Portrait_Devella_Fountainhead.png/25px-Portrait_Devella_Fountainhead.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Portrait_Devella_Fountainhead.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Devella_Fountainhead\" title=\"Devella Fountainhead\">Devella Fountainhead's</a> conjecture about murders: they all are perpetrated in reverence to century-old Bhaalists' exploits.\n</p><p>The corpses on which the letters are found match by race and gender the corrensponding Bhaalspawn, and even resemble them in appearance. The only exception is <b>Yaga-Shura</b>, who was a Fire Giant, but Orin used for his effigy heavyset, robust humans with light-ginger hair and beards, though. Details with which some of the murders were performed, too, hint onto particulars of members of <i>The Five</i> or of their deaths. However, if <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/38px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/50px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jaheira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira</a> is in the party, she might remark on these displays, telling exactly who is depicted in each case.\n</p><p>The letter devoted to <b>Amelyssan</b> (along with Dribbles' head) can be found on the body of Wilting Alex, chained to another five corpses, together again depicting the race / gender set of <i>the Five</i> Bhaalspawn\n</p><p>There are two copies of letter devoted to <b>Sendai</b> that can actually be found: on the body of two different drow females (which matches Sendai's race) lying in the ritual circle and in the adjacent room.\n</p><p><b>Balthazar</b> was the Bhaalspawn monk, leader of the monastery in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Calimshan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Calimshan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Calimshan\">Calimshan</a></span>. His namesake necromancer, disciple and advisor to General <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ketheric Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric Thorm</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>, confesses that he took his name, too, after taking his ribcage.\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Amelyssan\" title=\"Echo of Amelyssan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_Echo_of_Amelyssan.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Amelyssan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_Echo_of_Amelyssan.png/38px-Portrait_Echo_of_Amelyssan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_Echo_of_Amelyssan.png/50px-Portrait_Echo_of_Amelyssan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Echo of Amelyssan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_Echo_of_Amelyssan.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Amelyssan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Portrait_Echo_of_Amelyssan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Amelyssan\" title=\"Echo of Amelyssan\">Echo of Amelyssan</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Illasera\" title=\"Echo of Illasera\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png/38px-Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png/50px-Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Echo of Illasera\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Illasera\" title=\"Echo of Illasera\">Echo of Illasera</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Sendai\" title=\"Echo of Sendai\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png/38px-Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png/50px-Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Echo of Sendai\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Sendai\" title=\"Echo of Sendai\">Echo of Sendai</a> appear as lesser judges at the <a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Tribunal\" title=\"Murder Tribunal\">Murder Tribunal</a> beside <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/38px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/50px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sarevok Anchev\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\">Sarevok Anchev</a>. Should the player character choose to become an Unholy Assassin, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Abazigal\" title=\"Echo of Abazigal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png/38px-Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png/50px-Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Echo of Abazigal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Abazigal\" title=\"Echo of Abazigal\">Echo of Abazigal</a> also appears in the Dread Lord's Abbatoir, acting as a trader.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Dribbles_the_Clown\" title=\"Find Dribbles the Clown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Dribbles the Clown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Find_Dribbles_the_Clown\" title=\"Find Dribbles the Clown\">Find Dribbles the Clown</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki