bles-illasera-yagashura/\">All Orin's Murder Effigies Explained on GameRant</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202138\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.122 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.130 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8041/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 62188/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13448/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 10/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.060/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1007327/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  101.249      1 -total\n 61.90%   62.668     12 Template:SmRarityItem\n 54.70%   55.382     12 Template:Item_icon\n 32.79%   33.196    104 Template:Trim\n 30.11%   30.489     16 Template:Icon_link\n 28.90%   29.262     16 Template:Icon_text\n 27.39%   27.731     10 Template:CharLink\n 22.01%   22.286     40 Template:Ifempty\n 18.47%   18.696     24 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n 16.62%   16.828     40 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:40125-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202138 and revision id 339315. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}